title: Signal from the North.
subtitle: North has been enveloped in unrest...
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1928 and month = 1 and weeks >= 2
max-visits: 1 
on-arrival: {!
  const conditions = [
    Q.tariffs <= 0,
    Q.agricultural_policy <= 0,
    Q.unemployedc >= 5.8,
    Q.rural_dnvp_display >= 36.6,
    Q.sh_strength >= 600,
    Q.pro_republic <= 53,
    Q.nationalism > 21,
    Q.socialism > 20,
    Q.rural_z_display > 13.3,
    Q.local_rally > 0,
    Q.dnvp_relation > 25,
    Q.z_relation > 60,
    Q.ideology == "reformist",
    Q.rural > 21.30,
  ];
 
Q.landvolk_fury = conditions.filter(Boolean).length;
console.log("fury before subtract:", Q.landvolk_fury, typeof Q.landvolk_fury);
console.log("agricultural_assist:", Q.agricultural_assist, typeof Q.agricultural_assist);
Q.landvolk_fury -= Q.agricultural_assist || 0;
console.log("fury after subtract:", Q.landvolk_fury);
!}

​= Agrarian Revolts in Schleswig-Holstein

​Years of mistreatment and the collapse of their social standing have driven the rural population to despair, with [+ agricultural_minister +] failing to deliver on promises to enact tariffs. Tested further by harsh winter conditions, over 14,000 protesters have filled the streets, marching under the black flags of historical peasant rebellions.

​This is the birth of the Landvolkbewegung (Rural People's Movement). Led by Claus Heim and Wilhelm Hamkens and fiercely defensive of their regional identity, the crowd openly chants for a "Green Democracy" rooted in the ethnic community, flatly rejecting the cosmopolitan "Golden Democracy" of the capital.

- @evaluate_regional_echoes: The black flags are flying high...

@evaluate_regional_echoes
go-to: geest_ignited if landvolk_fury >= 6; geest_simmers if landvolk_fury < 6

@geest_ignited
on-departure: {!
  window.disableFocusMode()
  clearInterval(window._geestSliderInterval)
!}
on-arrival: {!
  window.enableFocusMode()
  window.MusicPlayer.loadFromUrl('music/landvolk.m4a', 'Landvolkbewegung', { autoplay: true });
  Q.geest_wildfire = 1;
  Q.nationalism += 3;
  Q.pro_republic -= 4;

  Q.rural_dnvp -= 5;
  Q.rural_dvp -= 3;
  Q.rural_ddp -= 2;
  Q.rural_z -= 4;
  Q.rural_spd -= 3;
  Q.rural_kpd += 1;
  Q.rural_nsdap += 2;
  Q.rural_other += 8;

  var geestImages = ["img/dnvp/geest_protest.png", "img/dnvp/geest_protest_2.png"];
  var geestIndex = 0;

  setTimeout(function() {
    var imgEl = document.getElementById("geest-slider-img");
    if (!imgEl) return;

    clearInterval(window._geestSliderInterval);
    window._geestSliderInterval = setInterval(function() {
      geestIndex = (geestIndex + 1) % geestImages.length;
      imgEl.src = geestImages[geestIndex];
    }, 4000);
  }, 0);
!}

= The Geest Radicalizes Completely

<div id="geest-slider" style="width:100%;">
  <img id="geest-slider-img" src="img/dnvp/geest_protest.png" alt="Landvolkbewegung" style="width:100%; display:block;">
</div>
​
Unrest on the Geest is spreading like wildfire. In these tight-knit peasant villages, where family members work side-by-side in the fields, no rigid class barriers exist to stop radical ideas from catching on. Backed by local Stahlhelm networks, smallholders have completely turned their backs on the National Rural League, condemning its aristocratic leadership as out-of-touch Junkers.

​Organizers report angry crowds tearing down mainstream party posters across the district. The farmers demand an organic corporate state—one that tears agriculture out of the capitalist market altogether. Tax strikes are spreading, and whole communities are physically blocking bailiffs from foreclosing on neighboring homesteads. The traditional conservative hold over the countryside is shattering from the bottom up.

Unrest level: [? if landvolk_fury <= 8: Relatively lower than expected. ?][? if landvolk_fury > 8 and landvolk_fury <= 10: Severe enough to shake the North. ?][? if landvolk_fury > 10: Has engulfed the entire country... ?]

@geest_simmers
on-arrival: {!
  Q.nationalism += 10;
  Q.pro_republic -= 10;
  Q.rural_dnvp += 1; // Lacking momentum, they begrudgingly stick with traditional choices
  Q.rural_qol -= 20;
window.enableFocusMode()
!}
achievement: winterschwelen 

= A Simmering, Bitter Provincial Winter

<div style="width:100%;">
  <img src="img/achievements/winterschwelen.png" alt="Landvolk Collapses" style="width:100%; display:block;">
</div>

I stared out at the dispersing crowd. Or what was left of it.

Beside me, my son pulled his thin coat tight against the biting wind. He looked up at the fading black banners, his eyes wide with quiet indignation.

"Is there no justice?" he asked. "Why couldn't we win?"

I had no answer for him then. We were not angry enough, not desperate enough. Most of all, we lacked unity—we had failed to coordinate[? if agricultural_assist > 0:, outmaneuvered and subdued by the *Golden Democrats*?].

I took one long, careful look at my son's frozen face. ​I thought I still had a son to fight for...

- @despair: ...

@despair
on-departure: {!
  window.disableFocusMode()
!}
on-arrival: tariffs += 1; agricultural_assist -= 1; rural -= 0.45; landvolk_fury = 0

Not anymore.

- @root: The cold winter's embrace shrouds this land.
